  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 22-layer TiO2/SiO2 dielectric stack on fused silica substrate at 45 degrees incidence. Layer sequence: TiO2-SiO2 repeated 11 times (22 finite layers total). Initialize thicknesses from candidate opt_22l_tio2_sio2_dualband_45deg____df990e3f65dc thickness profile [186.73, 122.66, 179.91, 193.56, 186.67, 89.69, 207.37, 111.87, 42.83, 79.15, 186.38, 63.29, 38.87, 104.96, 244.49, 67.10, 62.04, 93.08, 199.86, 243.32, 172.36, 62.45] nm. Allow each layer thickness to vary independently within bounds 30-250 nm. Optimize for maximum mean reflectance in 450-650 nm band and maximum mean transmittance in 700-1000 nm band. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer with population seeding from the provided profile. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 450-650 nm, 700-1000 nm. soft objectives: high reflectance in 450-650 nm; high transmittance in 700-1000 nm; minimized crosstalk between bands. behaviors to suppress or avoid: transmittance in 450-650 nm; reflectance in 700-1000 nm. manufacturing constraints: maximum 24 layers.",
